error[SC0212]: `each` names the subject of the call it is written in, and there is no call here
  --> tests/ui/resolve/each_in_record_field.science:12:27
   |
12 |     let doc be Doc(title: each)
   |                           ^^^^ no subject to name
   |
   = note: `each` stands for one argument's value inside a call, as in `docs.map(each.title)`
